# Docker build context of deploy/*/Dockerfile* = the unpacked ZIP root (mbnas_application/). Allowlist style: only what
# the Dockerfiles COPY reaches the builder; runtime state, datasets, env files with secrets, venvs and docs never do.
# Shipped in every bundle.
*
!requirements-public.txt
!requirements-owner.txt
!requirements-cpu.txt
!wheels/*.whl
!mbnas_web/dist/
!deploy/public/docker-entrypoint.sh
!deploy/owner/docker-entrypoint.sh
